  "reason": "Evidence: config_015 (scgpt, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted) achieved 0.520 accuracy, and config_012 (same but resnet50) achieved 0.494, confirming that imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted + multiprofile is the strongest architecture so far. Uncertainty: we have only tested scgpt as the RNA encoder; scvi_n200 (a variational autoencoder) encodes RNA very differently and may capture complementary or superior biological signal. This experiment (config_026: scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted, multimodal, multiprofile) is a clean single-variable swap against our current best, isolating the RNA encoder effect. It is the best use of experiment 3 because the RNA encoder is the highest-leverage untested design choice within the already-validated architecture, and resolving it early (with 7 experiments left) lets us commit the remaining budget to refining the winning combination rather than exploring a suboptimal RNA encoder."
}

